        "I've been challenged to six duels this week. All by the same man. All about the same cheese.",
        "Swinging from a chandelier looks easy. It isn't. I've been stuck up one since Thursday.",
        "Never trust a man with a perfectly curled moustache. Or a perfectly curled wig. Or perfectly curled anything.",
        "I bowed so low at court my hat fell off and rolled under the king. Dashing, but awkward.",
        "A swashbuckler never says 'ouch'. A swashbuckler says 'ha!'. Even when it should be 'ouch'.",
