      titles: ['The Clockwork {G}', 'The {G} Engine', 'Twenty Thousand {G}s Under the Sea', 'The Airship of {S}'],
      coda: ["Above {HOME}, a great brass airship drifted across the sunset, puffing steam and waving its little flags.", "THE CLOCKWORK INVENTOR: Marvellous work, {PLAYER}! I'll name my next invention after you. It'll make toast. On fire."],
